%SIXMD 1
# @?LOGD - CHECK AND ANNOUNCE LOGSTORE READINESS

## DESCRIPTION

LOGD PRESERVES THE DAIMOSV1 SERVICE ENTRY POINT USING THE CURRENT LOGSTORE.
IT VERIFIES THAT LOGSTORE IS AVAILABLE, APPENDS AN INFORMATIONAL READY EVENT,
AND REPORTS LOGSTORE READY.  PERSISTENT OR CONSOLE DRAINING IS PERFORMED BY
LOGDRAIN.

USAGE IS 'LOGD'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - LOGSTORE IS READY
### @?1 - LOGSTORE IS UNAVAILABLE

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?LOGDRAIN
### @?LOGDUMP
